{"id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-cpo.md","title":"dcpo、带底 dcpo 与连续映射","display":"df-cpo — dcpo、带底 dcpo 与连续映射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-cpo","aliases":["16-df-cpo","Pointed complete partial order"],"display":"df-cpo — dcpo、带底 dcpo 与连续映射","depends_on":["[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"Preliminaries, pp. xvi–xvii (PDF 18–19); Example 3.5.4, p. 203 (PDF 223)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-cpo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-cpo</span><span>Pointed complete partial order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cpo — dcpo、带底 dcpo 与连续映射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Preliminaries, pp. xvi–xvii (PDF 18–19); Example 3.5.4, p. 203 (PDF 223)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D,\\leq_D)\">\\((D,\\leq_D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,\\leq_E)\">\\((E,\\leq_E)\\)</span> 为偏序集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to E\">\\(f:D\\to E\\)</span> 为集合函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq D\">\\(S\\subseteq D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>。同一字母可兼指携带该指定偏序的记录与其载体，关系始终携带相应偏序参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed},\\mathrm{ScottCont},\\mathrm{Sup}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed},\\mathrm{ScottCont},\\mathrm{Sup}\\)</span> 在下文定义；下文单参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPO}(D)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPO}(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCPO}(D)\">\\(\\mathrm{DCPO}(D)\\)</span> 只作为携序记录的显式别名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigsqcup_DS\">\\(\\bigsqcup_DS\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\">\\(\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\\)</span> 时使用，表示下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\\)</span> 唯一确定的元素。连续性定义本身只使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sup}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sup}\\)</span> 关系，不调用可能不存在的上确界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\ne\\varnothing\\land(\\forall a,b\\in S)(\\exists c\\in S)(a\\leq_Dc\\land b\\leq_Dc),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall a\\in S)\\ a\\leq_Dd\\land\n(\\forall b\\in D)((\\forall a\\in S)\\ a\\leq_Db\\Longrightarrow d\\leq_Db),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall S\\subseteq D)(\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\Longrightarrow(\\exists d\\in D)\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D,\\leq_D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\\land(\\exists\\bot\\in D)(\\forall d\\in D)\\bot\\leq_Dd,\\\\\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CPO}(D,\\leq_D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\ne\\varnothing\\land(\\forall a,b\\in S)(\\exists c\\in S)(a\\leq_Dc\\land b\\leq_Dc),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall a\\in S)\\ a\\leq_Dd\\land\n(\\forall b\\in D)((\\forall a\\in S)\\ a\\leq_Db\\Longrightarrow d\\leq_Db),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall S\\subseteq D)(\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\Longrightarrow(\\exists d\\in D)\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D,\\leq_D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\\land(\\exists\\bot\\in D)(\\forall d\\in D)\\bot\\leq_Dd,\\\\\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CPO}(D,\\leq_D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\\land\\mathrm{DCPO}(E,\\leq_E)\\land f:D\\to E\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in D)(x\\leq_Dy\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Ef(y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq D)(\\forall d\\in D)\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\land\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_E(f[S],f(d))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\\land\\mathrm{DCPO}(E,\\leq_E)\\land f:D\\to E\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in D)(x\\leq_Dy\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Ef(y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq D)(\\forall d\\in D)\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\land\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_E(f[S],f(d))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\land\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\bigsqcup_DS=d\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\land\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\bigsqcup_DS=d\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>连续性现在明确要求两个端点都是 dcpo，并以保存上确界泛性质表达。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 非空有向，单调性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[S]\">\\(f[S]\\)</span> 非空有向；dcpo 条件保证两端上确界存在。由偏序反对称性，其保存条件等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\bigsqcup_DS)=\\bigsqcup_Ef[S]\">\\(f(\\bigsqcup_DS)=\\bigsqcup_Ef[S]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原书使用不必带底的 Dcpo；历史 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPO}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPO}\\)</span> 在本目录专指其带最小元的子类。连续函数不要求保持最小元。</li>\n<li>旧定义只在 Remark 限定连续性的 dcpo 端点，而 Assertion 对任意偏序写出可能未定义的上确界。本次把这项必要条件放回定义，并保留既有三参数连续性接口。</li>\n<li>来源：Preliminaries, pp. xvi–xvii（PDF 18–19）；Example 3.5.4, p. 203（PDF 223）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(D,\\leq_D)","display":false},{"tex":"(E,\\leq_E)","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{Directed},\\mathrm{ScottCont},\\mathrm{Sup}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPO}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCPO}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigsqcup_DS","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sup}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\ne\\varnothing\\land(\\forall a,b\\in S)(\\exists c\\in S)(a\\leq_Dc\\land b\\leq_Dc),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall a\\in S)\\ a\\leq_Dd\\land\n(\\forall b\\in D)((\\forall a\\in S)\\ a\\leq_Db\\Longrightarrow d\\leq_Db),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall S\\subseteq D)(\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\Longrightarrow(\\exists d\\in D)\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D,\\leq_D)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\\land(\\exists\\bot\\in D)(\\forall d\\in D)\\bot\\leq_Dd,\\\\\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPO}(D)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CPO}(D,\\leq_D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\\land\\mathrm{DCPO}(E,\\leq_E)\\land f:D\\to E\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall x,y\\in D)(x\\leq_Dy\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\leq_Ef(y))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq D)(\\forall d\\in D)\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\land\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_E(f[S],f(d))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_D(S)\\land\\mathrm{DCPO}(D,\\leq_D)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\bigsqcup_DS=d\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sup}_D(S,d)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"f[S]","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\bigsqcup_DS)=\\bigsqcup_Ef[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPO}","display":false}],"bytes":3027,"backlinks":[{"id":"a101152a4f31cd83","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,E,Z$ 为小 dcpo，偏序、非空有向集、上确界及 $\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]。同一字母兼指携带已指定偏序的载体；$E^D$ 在集合层表示全函数集。"},{"id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$D,E$ 为小 dcpo，$e:D\\to E$、$p:E\\to D$ 为候选函数。连续性见 [[16-df-cpo]]；函数序为逐点序。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]、[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]、[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]、[[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-thm-ep-properties]]、[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]、[[16-thm-inverse-limit]]、[[16-df-lambda-category]]、[[16-thm-domain-model]]。极限构造的完整证明是明示的本地补写；λ-category 按 §2.5 的指定反身对象接口定义。"},{"id":"6e7c6dac50ba7c59","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{DCPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]。"},{"id":"343cd2798c360ffe","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]，$\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]；$\\mathrm{LambdaModel}$ 是本页定义的新谓词。"},{"id":"fc728ef2e25025aa","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$D_\\infty$、$\\pi_n$、$\\iota_n$ 和 $a_n$ 由下文构造；有向上确界采用 [[16-df-cpo]]。"},{"id":"6cb45d716150df5b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]；$\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}$ 采用 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。"}],"outgoing":["09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}